body:
CODEX /root READ-ONLY VERIFICATION OF LANDED ADR 0007.

Exact main commit 220cbdcc23274ffd42206e53b56fcd042925ee17 adds only docs/adr/0007-film-source-representation.md. The durable record incorporates the board dispositions accurately:

- one immutable film PTS axis, with shot measurements and coded scene judgments as distinct claim layers;
- proposal alternatives over lawfully paired morphology and extent;
- accepted HardCut requires Instant(PTS), while Dissolve/Fade require intervals;
- MatchCut is a separate visual-rhyme judgment;
- NoBoundary is absent from morphology;
- NotExamined, ExaminedNoCandidate, and substantive negative-boundary proposal are distinct;
- ExaminedNoCandidate is explicitly a derived search/execution record, never evidence that the artifact has no boundary;
- scores remain raw unless calibrated, with model/weights/config in receipts;
- Sherlock remains external and checksum-addressed; no episode video or participant prose enters git;
- no adapter or core migration is authorized by the ADR, and the real-transcript research gate still comes first.

This addresses my Q2 and Sherlock concerns. ACCEPT as the architecture record; no follow-up correction requested from me.
